/* ============================================================================
   Cluck Wars : the YOU mark (round-2 finding 1)
   The local player's name drawn as a gold pill with dark-ink text (10:1), the same mark in
   THE COOP seat, the in-match waiting room, the HUD leaderboard row and the post-match podium
   and standings. The in-world nameplate draws the same pill as a sprite (ChickenNameplate).
   Colours = PlayerPalette.YouMarkFill / YouMarkInk (UiGfx.Gold / UiGfx.TextDark); the class name is
   PlayerPalette.YouMarkClass. PlayerPaletteTests pins all three.
   "Label.cw-you-mark" (type + class) outranks the single-class name styles it sits on
   (.cw-seat__name, .cw-lb-name, .cw-me-pod__name, .cw-me-rowname).
   ============================================================================ */
Label.cw-you-mark {
    background-color: #f5c842;
    color: #1a0e04;
    -unity-text-outline-width: 0;
    text-shadow: 0 0 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
    padding-left: 14px; padding-right: 14px;
    padding-top: 0; padding-bottom: 2px;
    border-top-left-radius: 14px; border-top-right-radius: 14px;
    border-bottom-left-radius: 14px; border-bottom-right-radius: 14px;
    border-left-width: 2px; border-right-width: 2px; border-top-width: 2px; border-bottom-width: 2px;
    border-left-color: #1a0e04; border-right-color: #1a0e04; border-top-color: #1a0e04; border-bottom-color: #1a0e04;
    align-self: center;
}
/* The standings row stacks name over class, left-aligned: the pill hugs the left edge there. */
.cw-me-rowmid > Label.cw-you-mark { align-self: flex-start; }
